    "created_at": "2015-09-03T12:39:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-03T12:39:14Z",
    "body": "Do want want to try to define media elements in terms of fetch as well? These are very unlike most other network requests in a browser, in that they use byte range requests and the fetch may never actually finish as it could be throttled to avoid downloading more than will be viewed.\n",
