    "updated_at": "2015-09-03T12:43:17Z",
    "body": "Yes we do. A fetch that never gets to \"process response end-of-file\" is fine. Setting a `Range` header on the request is fine too. Doing multiple requests should be fine. It might be a bit of work though to get that correct.\n\nThe only API that's excluded is `WebSocket` as it has its own protocol.\n",
