    "created_at": "2015-09-10T04:19:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-10T04:19:36Z",
    "body": "I tried to figure out if I could do \"referrer source\" or \"navigate\" separately, but so far I've determined that neither seems feasible. If I want to reference Referrer Policy I really need to pull in Fetch as well, which makes dropping referrer source unlikely since it handles a bunch of what Referrer Policy does. If I want to do navigate I really need the concepts of request and response since \"navigate to a new resource\" really means navigating to either a request or a response. (Although maybe there's some additional data in case of history traversal.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
